    "video": {
      "name": "Keto Protein Coffee Smoothie [Keto Proffee Recipe]",
      "description": "This is the perfect morning or afternoon pick-me-up and it’s ready in less than 5 minutes! If you’re looking to combine the rich, satisfying flavor of coffee with the satiating benefits of protein, you’re in for a treat. This recipe is a great solution for those seeking an easy, quick, balanced and nourishing start to their day.\n\nProtein Coffee, or “Proffee”, combines two essential elements: your favorite brewed coffee and a high-quality protein source. It’s very versatile and customizable – whether you prefer whey, plant-based, or collagen protein powder, you have the freedom to choose the option that aligns with your dietary preferences and goals. If you’re not a fan of instant coffee, feel free to use cold brew coffee or espresso shots. You can swap out the sweetener or nut milk for your preferred versions, too.\n\nLooking to make in bulk? Freeze the proffee in an ice cube tray and then blend back up when you’re ready to enjoy it!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1 tablespoon instant coffee\n1 ounce low-carb protein powder\n1 tablespoon allulose\n1 tablespoon boiling water\n1/4 cup heavy cream\n1 cup unsweetened almond milk\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 1 serving of Keto Protein-Packed Coffee Smoothie. The serving comes out to be 337 calories, 24.5g fats, 3g net carbs, and 25g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
